      "text": "[9:20p.m.] #IkoroduRoad #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is smooth descending the Dorman-Long Bridge to Fadeyi, moving to Onipan, Palmgrove, Obanikoro, Anthony, Idiroko, Harbour Works, through the Independence Tunnel, Odo-Iyalaro Bridge, New Garage, and Ojota inwards the Interchange.\n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@HeroPrince_21 \n@tobiidowu_ \n@Gidi_Traffic",
