      "text": "[9:30p.m.] #Maryland #MobolajiBankAnthony #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic is good from Anthony on the Service Lane inward Maryland Mall, to Maryland inward Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way to Cantonment, G-Cappa Estate, Sheraton, Country Club, all the way to Unity and Kodesho Street inward Ikeja bridge.\n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@HeroPrince_21 \n@tobiidowu_ \n@Gidi_Traffic",
